WEBVTT

00:02:26.299 --> 00:02:31.352
(te qeshura)

00:02:31.352 --> 00:02:38.069
Publiku: Shkund. Palos.

00:02:38.069 --> 00:02:43.731
JS: Ajo qe pritet vete.

00:02:43.731 --> 00:02:44.888
Gjeja me argetuese eshte se

00:02:44.888 --> 00:02:47.063
une i thaj duart me mire se ata qe 
perdorin tre apo kater letra,

00:02:47.063 --> 00:02:49.511
sepse ata nuk arrijne neper te carat.

00:02:49.511 --> 00:02:52.655
Nese mendoni se kjo nuk eshte aq e mire...

00:02:52.655 --> 00:03:01.124
Publiku: Shkund. Palos.